WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:01.040
- Well, I know we're going to talk more

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:02.520
about your health later,
but I have to ask,

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.460
like, how are you feeling?

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:04.350
- I'm feeling great.

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.483
- Yeah?

00:00:05.483 --> 00:00:07.052
- Yeah. I'm mean, I'm feeling so good.

00:00:07.052 --> 00:00:08.470
(audience applauds)

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.068
- [Kelly] Awesome. Your hair looks good.

00:00:10.068 --> 00:00:10.901
- Thank you.

00:00:10.901 --> 00:00:13.550
- A lot of women love this
photo that you posted recently.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.580
So will you tell us
about it? It's beautiful.

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:17.720
- Thank you. It was, you
know, one of those moments.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.620
I think my husband had
already gone to bed,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.940
my dog was, like, snoring
in her bed next to me.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.890
I had just finished watching "The Matrix",

00:00:23.890 --> 00:00:25.784
which is, like, one of my
all time favorite movies.

00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:26.617
- Oh my God, I love it.

00:00:26.617 --> 00:00:28.240
- And then "John Wick" came on,

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.765
which is also one of my favorite movies.

00:00:29.765 --> 00:00:30.598
- Love it.

00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:32.937
- Love. So I was watching
it and I was like,

00:00:32.937 --> 00:00:34.457
"God", you know, like,

00:00:34.457 --> 00:00:37.110
"Look at Keanu Reeves
playing this character

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:38.870
and he's just him", right?

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:41.860
There's not surgery, there's not Botox,

00:00:41.860 --> 00:00:43.490
like he's a man and he's older,

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:46.701
but he's still playing
this, you know, action--

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:48.417
- I feel like that's
celebrated more with men.

00:00:48.417 --> 00:00:49.940
- And that was my point.

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.270
- Oh. Sorry.

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.040
- I'm not against women
getting plastic surgery.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:56.280
Like, whatever works for you, go do it.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:58.170
I'm not saying not to.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.040
I just was saying, wouldn't it be nice

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:04.570
if there could be a "John
Wick" type thing for women?

00:01:04.570 --> 00:01:09.485
Wouldn't it be nice if we
celebrate women at all stages?

00:01:09.485 --> 00:01:10.960
(audience applauds)

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:13.980
- Men are always, like,
"Ooh, a fine glass of wine."

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:15.090
You know, as they age.

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:17.690
And like, we get gray and
it's like, "They're done!"

00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:20.000
- And the guys always have,
like, the young, like,

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:23.320
the co-stars, like, a 20 year old female.

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:26.303
- Who would totally be
interested in them in real life.

00:01:26.303 --> 00:01:27.709
(audience laughs)

00:01:27.709 --> 00:01:29.320
- Right? You know, so it's
like, "Wait. What is happening?"

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:31.860
And why can't we have also movies

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.792
that represent women that don't look like

00:01:34.792 --> 00:01:36.490
they're completely done.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:39.330
That do look a little bit more
real. That do have wrinkles.

00:01:39.330 --> 00:01:41.215
- [Kelly] Yeah, I think it's
all about being inclusive.

00:01:41.215 --> 00:01:43.280
- You know, like, I've got this
thing going on with my neck.

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:44.843
Like, that's okay. Let's celebrate it.

00:01:44.843 --> 00:01:45.780
- I've had these lines
since, like, junior high.

00:01:45.780 --> 00:01:48.274
I don't care. Like, whatever. Get over it.

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.890
- I just say, "I'm super busy
on my iPad" or something,

00:01:49.890 --> 00:01:50.910
that's what's creating it.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:52.980
- Well, mine, I'm so expressive, too.

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.380
I'm like, very expressive,
even when I was young.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:57.170
And I love that. It's a well lived life.

00:01:57.170 --> 00:01:58.438
But anyway, I think all
should be celebrated.

00:01:58.438 --> 00:01:59.384
Whatever you be.

00:01:59.384 --> 00:02:00.217
- Agreed.

